+        </div></div>
 
-  <h3>Do you have a list of the licence agreements you've entered into?</h3>
-  <p>There is no public list as the agreements are confidential, including the names of the parties involved.</p>
+        <div class="card faq-card mb-3"><div class="card-body">
+          <h3 class="h5">Why do some other organisations have related trademarks?</h3>
+          <p>These generally fall into one of a number of categories:</p>
+          <ul>
+            <li>They are unauthorised, and may be (if appropriate) or are being disputed.</li>
+            <li>The organisation has a licence agreement with us and has agreed to phase out their trademark registrations.</li>
+            <li>They are an NPO who follow the community NPO guidelines, such as PostgreSQL Europe, who are working with PGCA to adopt pre-existing marks into the community framework.</li>
+          </ul>
+        </div></div>
 
-  <h2>Governance</h2>
+        <div class="card faq-card mb-3"><div class="card-body">
+          <h3 class="h5">Do you have a list of the licence agreements you've entered into?</h3>
