+        </div></div>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+  </div>
+</div>
 
-  <h3>Why aren't there open and public elections to the PGCA board?</h3>
-  <p>It's essential to make sure that it's not possible for a rogue actor to attempt to take over PGCA and gain
