+        <div class="card faq-card mb-3"><div class="card-body">
+          <h3 class="h5">Why aren't there open and public elections to the PGCA board?</h3>
+          <p>It's essential to make sure that it's not possible for a rogue actor to attempt to take over PGCA and gain
