+        <a class="link-anchor" id="2025-07-02" name="2025-07-02"></a>
+        <h3><span class="bd-content-title text-emphasis">PGCA Sponsorship prospectus updated<a class="anchorjs-link" aria-label="Anchor" href="#2025-07-02"></a></span></h3>
+        <h5 class="mt-0 mb-4">2 July 2025</h5>
+        <p>As of July 2025, the sponsorship prospectus for the PostgreSQL
+          Community Association (PGCA) has been updated. The volunteer-run
+          PGCA non-profit relies entirely on sponsorship and donations from
+          corporations and individuals like you.
+        </p>
+        <p>The PGCA Board and the PostgreSQL Core Team deeply appreciate the
+          generous financial support we receive from corporations, small
+          businesses, and individual donors. Your annual contributions make
+          it possible for us to protect the PostgreSQL brand assets.
+        </p>
+        <p>To learn more about sponsorship levels, where your sponsorship
+          dollars will go, and how PGCA recognizes donors—please review the
+          <a href="/static/pdf/pgca-funding-2025.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">updated PGCA
+            sponsorship prospectus.</a>
+        </p>
