+        <h5 class="mt-0 mb-4">14 May 2025</h5>
+        <p>Following an AGM and board meeting held at PGConf.dev 2025 in Montreal, the
+          PostgreSQL Community Association of Canada's board has been confirmed
+          as:</p>
+        <ul>
+          <li>Dave Page (Chairman)</li>
+          <li>Steve Singer (Treasurer)</li>
+          <li>Jonathan Katz (Secretary)</li>
+          <li>Jaime Casanova</li>
+          <li>Peter Eisentraut</li>
+          <li>Marc Fournier</li>
+          <li>Claire Giordano</li>
+        </ul>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="card">
